#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Gate Cutting to Reduce Circuit Depth"
msgstr "Gate Cutting para Bawasan ang Circuit Depth"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/02_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_depth.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/02_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_depth.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this tutorial, we will reduce a circuit's depth by cutting distant gates, avoiding the swap gates that would otherwise be introduced by routing.\n"
msgstr "Sa tutorial na ito, babawasan natin ang depth ng isang circuit sa pamamagitan ng pagputol ng mga distant gate, upang maiwasan ang mga swap gate na kung hindi man ay maipapasok ng routing.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These are the steps that we will take in this [Qiskit pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns):\n"
msgstr "Ito ang mga hakbang na gagawin natin sa [Qiskit pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns):\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map problem to quantum circuits and operators**:\n"
msgstr "**Hakbang 1: I-map ang problema sa quantum circuits at operators**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map the hamiltonian onto a quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr "I-map ang hamiltonian sa isang quantum circuit.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize for target hardware** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Hakbang 2: I-optimize para sa target hardware** [_Ginagamit ang cutting addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Cut the circuit and observable.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Putulin ang circuit at observable.</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the subexperiments for hardware.\n"
msgstr "I-transpile ang mga subexperiment para sa hardware.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute on target hardware**:\n"
msgstr "**Hakbang 3: Isagawa sa target hardware**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments obtained in Step 2 using a `Sampler` primitive.\n"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang mga subexperiment na nakuha sa Hakbang 2 gamit ang isang `Sampler` primitive.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Post-process results** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Hakbang 4: I-post-process ang mga resulta** [_Ginagamit ang cutting addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Combine the results of Step 3 to reconstruct the expectation value of the observable in question.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Pagsamahin ang mga resulta ng Hakbang 3 upang ma-reconstruct ang expectation value ng observable na pinag-uusapan.</font>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map {#step-1-map}"
msgstr "Hakbang 1: Map {#step-1-map}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a circuit to run on the backend {#create-a-circuit-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr "Gumawa ng circuit na ipapatakbo sa backend {#create-a-circuit-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_1.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify an observable {#specify-an-observable}"
msgstr "Tukuyin ang isang observable {#specify-an-observable}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize {#step-2-optimize}"
msgstr "Hakbang 2: Optimize {#step-2-optimize}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify a backend {#specify-a-backend}"
msgstr "Tukuyin ang isang backend {#specify-a-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can provide either a fake backend or a hardware backend from Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr "Maaari kang magbigay ng alinman sa fake backend o hardware backend mula sa Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the circuit, visualize the swaps, and note the depth {#transpile-the-circuit-visualize-the-swaps-and-note-the-depth}"
msgstr "I-transpile ang circuit, i-visualize ang mga swap, at tandaan ang depth {#transpile-the-circuit-visualize-the-swaps-and-note-the-depth}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We choose a layout that requires two swaps to execute the gates between qubits 3 and 0 and another two swaps to return the qubits to their initial positions.\n"
msgstr "Pumipili tayo ng layout na nangangailangan ng dalawang swap upang isagawa ang mga gate sa pagitan ng qubits 3 at 0 at isa pang dalawang swap upang ibalik ang mga qubit sa kanilang inisyal na posisyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_2.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replace distant gates with `TwoQubitQPDGate`s by specifying their indices {#replace-distant-gates-with-twoqubitqpdgates-by-specifying-their-indices}"
msgstr "Palitan ang mga distant gate ng `TwoQubitQPDGate`s sa pamamagitan ng pagtukoy ng kanilang mga indices {#replace-distant-gates-with-twoqubitqpdgates-by-specifying-their-indices}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`cut_gates` will replace the gates in the specified indices with `TwoQubitQPDGate`s and also return a list of `QPDBasis` instances -- one for each gate decomposition.\n"
msgstr "Ang `cut_gates` ay papalitan ang mga gate sa tinukoy na mga index ng `TwoQubitQPDGate`s at magbabalik din ng listahan ng mga `QPDBasis` instance -- isa para sa bawat gate decomposition.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_3.png)\n"
msgstr "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_3.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate the subexperiments to run on the backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr "Bumuo ng mga subexperiment na patatakbuhin sa backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`generate_cutting_experiments` accepts a circuit containing `TwoQubitQPDGate` instances and observables as a `PauliList`.\n"
msgstr "Ang `generate_cutting_experiments` ay tumatanggap ng circuit na naglalaman ng mga `TwoQubitQPDGate` instance at observables bilang `PauliList`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To simulate the expectation value of the full-sized circuit, many subexperiments are generated from the decomposed gates' joint quasiprobability distribution and then executed on one or more backends. The number of samples taken from the distribution is controlled by `num_samples`, and one combined coefficient is given for each unique sample. For more information on how the coefficients are calculated, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Upang i-simulate ang expectation value ng full-sized na circuit, maraming subexperiment ang nabubuo mula sa joint quasiprobability distribution ng mga decomposed na gate at pagkatapos ay isinasagawa sa isa o higit pang backend. Ang bilang ng mga sample na kinukuha mula sa distribution ay kinokontrol ng `num_samples`, at isang combined coefficient ang ibinibigay para sa bawat unique sample. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon kung paano kinakalkula ang mga coefficient, sumangguni sa [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** The ``observables`` kwarg to `generate_cutting_experiments` is of type `PauliList`. Observable term coefficients and phases are ignored during decomposition of the problem and execution of the subexperiments. They may be re-applied during reconstruction of the expectation value.\n"
msgstr "**Tandaan:** Ang ``observables`` kwarg sa `generate_cutting_experiments` ay may type na `PauliList`. Ang mga observable term coefficient at phase ay binabalewala sa panahon ng decomposition ng problema at execution ng mga subexperiment. Maaari silang ilapat muli sa panahon ng reconstruction ng expectation value.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calculate the sampling overhead for the chosen cuts {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"
msgstr "Kalkulahin ang sampling overhead para sa napiling mga cut {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we cut three CNOT gates, resulting in a sampling overhead of $9^3$.\n"
msgstr "Dito, pinuputol natin ang tatlong CNOT gate, na nagreresulta sa sampling overhead na $9^3$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more on the sampling overhead incurred by circuit cutting, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Para sa higit pa tungkol sa sampling overhead na nakukuha mula sa circuit cutting, sumangguni sa [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Demonstrate that the QPD subexperiments will be shallower after cutting distant gates {#demonstrate-that-the-qpd-subexperiments-will-be-shallower-after-cutting-distant-gates}"
msgstr "Ipakita na ang mga QPD subexperiment ay magiging mas shallow pagkatapos putulin ang mga distant gate {#demonstrate-that-the-qpd-subexperiments-will-be-shallower-after-cutting-distant-gates}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here is an example of an arbitrarily chosen subexperiment generated from the QPD circuit. Its depth has been reduced by more than half. Many of these probabilistic subexperiments must be generated and evaluated in order to reconstruct an expectation value of the deeper circuit.\n"
msgstr "Narito ang halimbawa ng isang arbitraryong napiling subexperiment na nabuo mula sa QPD circuit. Ang depth nito ay nabawasan nang higit sa kalahati. Marami sa mga probabilistic subexperiment na ito ang dapat mabuo at masuri upang ma-reconstruct ang isang expectation value ng mas malalim na circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_4.png)\n"
msgstr "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_4.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare subexperiments for the backend {#prepare-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"
msgstr "Ihanda ang mga subexperiment para sa backend {#prepare-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute {#step-3-execute}"
msgstr "Hakbang 3: Execute {#step-3-execute}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments using the Qiskit Runtime Sampler primitive {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang mga subexperiment gamit ang Qiskit Runtime Sampler primitive {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process {#step-4-post-process}"
msgstr "Hakbang 4: Post-process {#step-4-post-process}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct the expectation value {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"
msgstr "I-reconstruct ang expectation value {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct expectation values for each observable term and combine them to reconstruct the expectation value for the original observable.\n"
msgstr "I-reconstruct ang expectation values para sa bawat observable term at pagsamahin ang mga ito upang ma-reconstruct ang expectation value para sa orihinal na observable.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the reconstructed expectation value with the exact expectation value from the original circuit and observable {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr "Ikumpara ang reconstructed expectation value sa exact expectation value mula sa orihinal na circuit at observable {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
msgstr "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
